        "original_id": "b49a3383-74da-5b27-84b9-f737706ff149",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Milo Parker, Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, Gillian Anderson, Anke Engelke, Bastian Pastewka\n- Products: Robot Overlords, Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails, Mr. Holmes, Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children\n- Roles: Connor, Roger Munro, Hugh Apiston, Hugo\n- Topics: British child actors, films\n\nFacts:\n- Milo Parker was born in 2002 and is a British child actor.\n- Robot Overlords, originally titled Our Robot Overlords, is a 2014 British independent science fiction film starring Callan McAuliffe, Ben Kingsley, and Gillian Anderson.\n- Ghost Hunters on Icy Trails is a 2015 German-Austrian-Irish comedy film starring Anke Engelke, Milo Parker, and Bastian Pastewka as the voice of Hugo.\n- Milo Parker is known for playing Connor in Robot Overlords, Roger Munro in Mr. Holmes, and Hugh Apiston in Miss Peregrine's Home for Peculiar Children.",
